# The port's half of the kaon- like-for-like; its partner is kaon_minus_emonly.mac.
#
# MEASURED, 500,000 events:
#
#   kaon-  port 1239.62 +/- 1.303 nGy   Geant4 1131.87 +/- 1.195   +9.52%, 61.0 sigma
#
# The port's own two kaons differ by 0.270% (1242.97 against 1239.62), which is the split its
# range and dE/dx tables imply. Geant4's own two differ by 9.62%. See kaon_minus_emonly.mac and
# docs/RISK.md.

/run/initialize
/control/verbose 0
/run/verbose 1

/gun/particle kaon-
/gun/energy 200 MeV

/run/printProgress 100000
/run/beamOn 500000
